{
  "id": "compressed_water___properties_vs__temperature",
  "title": "Compressed Water - Properties vs. Temperature",
  "description": "Specific volume, enthalpy and entropy of compressed water at various temperatures and pressures",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Compressed Water - Properties vs. Temperature\n\nThis tool provides specific volume (_v_), enthalpy (_h_), and entropy (_s_) of compressed water as functions of temperature and pressure.\n\n## Key Parameters:\n- **Temperature (t)**: 0.01°C to 374.15°C\n- **Pressure (p)**: 1 to 1000 bar\n\n## Output Properties:\n- **Specific Volume (v)**: m³/kg\n- **Enthalpy (h)**: kJ/kg\n- **Entropy (s)**: kJ/kg·K"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature",
          "label": "Temperature (t)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure",
          "label": "Pressure (p)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "bar",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "specific_volume",
          "label": "Specific Volume (v)",
          "unit": "m³/kg",
          "formula": "0.001 * (1 - 0.0001 * inputs.pressure) + 0.0001 * inputs.temperature",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "enthalpy",
          "label": "Enthalpy (h)",
          "unit": "kJ/kg",
          "formula": "419 * (inputs.temperature / 100) - 2 * (inputs.pressure / 100)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "entropy",
          "label": "Entropy (s)",
          "unit": "kJ/kg·K",
          "formula": "1.307 * (inputs.temperature / 100) - 0.008 * (inputs.pressure / 100)",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Temperature (°C)",
        "Pressure (bar)",
        "v-vf (m³/kg)",
